message: "If you use this software or the associated analysis pipeline, please cite it as below."
title: "A six-gate falsification framework for diagnosing locus-driven confounding in Mendelian randomization: analysis code, simulation benchmark and frozen results"
abstract: "Analysis pipeline and frozen results for a six-gate falsification framework for Mendelian randomization-based causal claims, applied to insomnia-Alzheimer's disease comorbidity. Includes bidirectional MR, LDSC r_g, colocalization, two-step protein and metabolite mediation MR, MVMR, education PheWAS, East Asian cross-ancestry replication, a 43,200-replicate simulation benchmark with the decisive-failure rule applied, and a threshold/cap robustness analysis."
